Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, fighting for\Ntomorrow. Go catch what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, run\Nlike a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, believe\Nyou can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora, he has nothing to gain from\Nsomeone who only longs for destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's above that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you leave him the hell alone,\Nbecause Law is finally free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I still haven't been able to\Nfulfill your hopes for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's what I'm here to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Vroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally stopped, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you make of Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You were once a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have something\Ninteresting to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you make of the will of D?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I indulge you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that this is his fate? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat was led here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My divine blood enticed\Nhim to come and kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,a bunch of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing; those who fear the inheritors\Nof d have given them another title.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sworn enemy of gods, I'm also a d.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you update me on the situation, Viola?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, things are not\Ngoing well at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat has been knocked below.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Law is struggling against Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, that is not the only battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to the clashes on\Nthe plateau and at the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,there are also battles\Nnear the statue of Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the Smile Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to restrain them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Their victims keep filing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We must end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We defeated some of the executives, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So how many of them are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a few, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned, this Mile Factory\Nis one of the major battlefields.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's still protected by the\Nfree-swimming man, Senor Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a top executive\Nfighting on the giant statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The stone assimilation man, Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then of course there's the center of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,our struggle on the top\Nlevel of the plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There lies the despot king and string man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With him is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,his chief of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,staff the mucus man treble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the sunflower field directly below the\Npalace there's the hero of the coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,known as the Flag Man, Diamante.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath them, on the third level,\Nis the Rupture Man, Gladius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four executives\Non the second level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Half-Fighting Fish Fishman, Tellinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Geo-Fist Master, Lao-G.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The superweight man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mach Vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And the full body weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Altogether that's 10 executives to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That breeze is hurtin' my tear ducts, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so hard-boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But these battles are wearing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And many of the fighters\Nare already injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So the end of this battle\Nmay be close at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Army Bandera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ground. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even make the ground ripple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems hard to stand with one leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Know you're worried about your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now piano!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Such feeble attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost put me to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,En garde, Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Destruction cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten-ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You do want me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right, ma 'am? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed up just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know where it is safe, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If Luffy and Law cannot stop Doflamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the people in the Birdcage\Nwill never be freed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the kingdom is in the\Nhands of two pirates and that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a hidden name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're destined to\Ncome here and defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can stop me\Nbecause of some letter in your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're the sworn enemy\Nof the gods, driven by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rubbish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Kofi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in range of his power right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Injection!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo knew that it would take more\Nthan a measly D to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, when I learned the truth,\Nmy fate changed all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My name was the Catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,listen I'm only here because\NCora was too kind-hearted to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,pull the trigger that day so\Nnow I'm going to do it for him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this one bit. Now room
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't iterate that enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I did us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiderweb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stumples!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stumples!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These pathetic attacks of yours\Nare degrading to both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can win with guts alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when did you become so
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,sentimental?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're not looking\Nat the big picture here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've spent your whole life getting\Nhung up on meaningless little details.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you've never\Nbeen able to seize the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,moment law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Worrying about other people's pain\Nis a sign of being small-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It only leads to self-destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite this failure, you'd be perfectly\Ncapable of killing me if you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming you stuck to the plan and\Nstarted a fight between Kaido and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,there's plenty of ways to take out someone\Nstronger than you, if you're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you weren't smart at all,\Ninstead you were emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And the moment you decided you had to\Navenge Corazon with your own two hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you condemned yourself to certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All this talk reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that secret message?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If a marine sees this, they would\Nknow exactly what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A faraway kingdom called Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who gave this\Nto you, but I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of\Nthis, so don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon did a splendid job of\Nundermining me to save this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything was going to work\Nout fine until you blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That face says you do remember,\Nand it must sting, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:16:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're responsible for\NCorazon's death as much as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine how history might have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every tragedy that befell this\Nkingdom could have been avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you delivered that message.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't lose your cool this\Ntime. You're learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with that message,\NI would have found a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, the throne\Nwould still have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Korra's own\Nsacrifice was meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The effort he put forth was meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who can decide that is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:17:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that I do until I\Ndie Is a part of Korra's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why that almost brings a\Ntear to your eye, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's true, everything\Nthat's done for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Becomes a part of your\Nlegacy etched in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when you ate the\Nop-op fruit and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or when you bared your\Nfangs at me on Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Or when you came here and\Nchallenged me in my own kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a good one, doofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats the good old Sixth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you were influenced by the other D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But as I said, everything that's\Nhappened is etched in stone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no changing the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I forgave my father\Nand forgave my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats a lead bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For a proper execution, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Fee's double.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He got all busted up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the cage was\Na bit too small, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known you\Nwouldn't be so easy to contain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Bellamy go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't realize he was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy! Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had my fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free from me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you've always been, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us used to live in Ortiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a wealthy city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's boring as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the Don Quixote family\Nis the bride of the north blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to be a real pirate\Ncrew one just like you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not like those other pirates out\Nthere with their heads in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We see things your way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you use our jolly Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.45,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fee
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch is if you're ever defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need weaklings as my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't lose to anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hanging in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know you're not great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, the time when pirates\Ndreamt about the future is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've eaten a cursed fruit too, and\Nyou don't stand a chance against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, I saw the\NSky Island just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost all my crewmates on that trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But it turned my view of\Nthe world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to hold a\Ngrudge against you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm done laughing at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:21:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have changed, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just rest for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joker is ordering me\Nto murder Straw Hat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolphy's a generous leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you lost the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he's giving you one more\Nchance to redeem yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy your task is so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're standing there\Nand not murdering Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,then I say you're not busy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me to give you a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, weird. An earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want me to spell\Nit out for you? All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your purpose has never\Nbeen the same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.12,0:22:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.78,0:22:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta leave you here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.34,0:23:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm real worried about Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Mingo and Snot Guy are up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.02,0:23:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give Mingo an extra kick\Nin the ass for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember this technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring Hopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got stronger since last\Ntime, but I got stronger too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.32,0:23:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see destructive power?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking this to the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally free!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.88,0:23:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now cut it out before you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.60,0:23:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.51,0:23:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop showing mercy to your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm pitiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.62,0:23:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I looked up to the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to hear it from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.51,0:24:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for the victor to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.62,0:24:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This pitiful worm,\Ncrawled here just to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I made my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't turn on him just because\NI didn't get what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.80,0:24:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't see this through to the\Nend, then I'll be worse than a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a complete disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.60,0:24:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hold on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.56,0:24:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a loser like me has some dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.81,0:24:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be my final battle, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.20,0:24:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,See it through to the end with me!
